# The project descriptor: settings true of the whole project, not of one page. One per project.
# renderer — the design system the project paints with:
#   vaadin  (io.mateu:mateu-vaadin, the default)
#   redwood (io.mateu:mateu-redwood — Oracle JET + Spectra, loaded from Oracle's CDN)
#   primer  (io.mateu:mateu-primer — GitHub's Primer React, preview; the editor previews it with Vaadin)
#   ui5     (io.mateu:mateu-ui5 — SAP's UI5 Web Components / Fiori, preview; the editor previews it with Vaadin)
#   slds    (io.mateu:mateu-slds — Salesforce's Lightning Design System, preview; the editor previews it with Vaadin)
# The visual editor's canvas and Play open in it and the static bundle ships it. A served app
# renders with its Maven dependency; the server warns at startup when the two disagree.
type: Project
renderer: vaadin
